n></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>2025年7月17日-19日</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（具体结营时间以项目通知为准）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动地点</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>深圳</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动设置</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>考核、校园参观、体验课、分享会等</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（具体以各项目通知为准）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>*如因不可抗力因素导致上述安排有所调整，我们将第一时间通知各位同学。香港中文大学（深圳）经管学院及深圳高等金融研究院保留最终解释权。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请要求</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>申请者需同时符合以下三个条件：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>大学本科三年级学生（2026年应届毕业生），不限专业；</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“985工程”院校的学生： 本科前2年（或前5学期）成绩排名在专业或年级的前50%；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>“211工程”院校的学生： 本科前2年（或前5学期）成绩排名在专业或年级的前30%；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>非“211工程”/“985工程”院校的学生： 本科前2年（或前5学期）成绩排名在专业或年级的前10%；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>个别高水平大学可适当放宽标准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>英语水平要求：英语四级不低于550分；或英语六级不低于520分；或雅思（学术类）不低于6.5(考试中心/Online)；或托福不低于550(笔试)/79(机考/在家考)；或GMAT (Verbal)不低于21分/GMAT (Verbal) Focus Edition 不低于78分；或其它可证明英文水平的考试。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1、本科前5学期（或前3年）在校成绩单（由校级部门盖章）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>*申请者需上传官方开具的完整成绩单及绩点计算说明扫描件，若成绩单上无平均绩点或者无均分体现，则请同时上传一份学校开具的官方均分（加权平均分）证明。多份文件建议合成一份以PDF格式上传。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、本科前5学期（或前3年）在校成绩排名（由校级部门盖章）；模板：深高金官网 sfi.cuhk.edu.cn，点击“入学申请”进入页面，浏览并找到“资料下载”板块；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、相关英语能力资格证书扫描件，如英语四级、六级、托福、雅思、GMAT等；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4、在读证明扫描件；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5、个人陈述（英文）：600字左右；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>6、个人简历（中英文）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>7、至少两封推荐信，提交申请后系统将自动发送邮件至推荐人邮箱，推荐人需按照邮件说明提交推荐信，并电子/手写签名后上传；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>8、身份证正反面扫描件（须将身份证正反面扫描至同一页）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>9、其他证明材料，如已发表的论文扫描件、奖状扫描件、各类证书扫描件等；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>10、建议但不强制要求提交个人介绍视频：1分钟时长（个人全英语录制）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>*需上传个人介绍视频的申请人，请上传视频至第三方平台（小红书或抖音），将视频链接粘贴至PDF文件内，上传至申请系统中的“其他文件”项内。项目组将通过点击链接的方式查看申请人的个人介绍视频。</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人须登录申请系统在线提交申请材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请系统：</span></p><p><span>https://pgapply.cuhk.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>*夏令营申请无需本科院校推免资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>| 申请开放时间</span></strong></p><p><span>2025年5月1日00:00</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>| 申请截止时间</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2025年6月15日23:59</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>关于费用</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、申请费用100元，不设退款；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2、住宿免费，由学校统一安排（具体等后续项目组通知）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>3、交通费：报销上限500元*的交通费；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>4、保险：我院将为学生购买人身意外险；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>5、参加者需自行承担自费活动和自由活动所产生的个人消费。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注意事项：</span></span></p><p><span><span>*每人报销上限500元的交通费，仅限汽车票，火车硬座票、硬卧票，高铁、动车二等座及以下的车票或经济舱机票。报销条件手续, 请等待后续通知。若因其他不可抗力因素影响改为线上进行，相关部分的补贴和住宿等将不再适用。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>温馨提示</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025夏令营（体验营）各项目的具体考核安排由各项目自行确定，并通知受邀申请人。本次夏令营（体验营）实行平行志愿制度，申请人所申项目数量不做限制，但最终每位申请人只能选择接受1个项目的线下入营邀约和预录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询电话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>金融学理学硕士项目</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（0755）2337-2680 / 2648</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>经济学理学硕士项目</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（0755）8427-3454 / 3417</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>会计理学硕士项目</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（0755）8427-3474</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>数据科学理学硕士项目</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（0755）8427-3878</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>市场学理学硕士项目</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（0755）8427-3423 / 3424</span>